{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>燒賣熱量｜魚蛋熱量｜街頭小食熱量卡路里排名，無論是「掃街」、下午茶、宵夜時段，燒賣、魚蛋等魔力好難拒抗？但不要以為街頭小食細細份，吃多了也</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210511/468841923809906688742915.jpeg/PzulnUNB0oDZE2nDHWA_NEIeLP4hveZnbQi090cItPc\" alt=\"5粒燒賣熱量多過一碗白飯。（資料圖片）\"><figcaption>5粒燒賣熱量多過一碗白飯。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>《香港01》「好食玩飛」記者整理了9款受歡迎的街頭小食的熱量排行，包括生菜魚肉、燒賣、咖哩魚蛋、章魚小丸子、腸粉、煎釀三寶、雞蛋仔、格仔餅、碗仔翅，以一碗白飯 260 千卡計算，榜首的小食熱量等如3碗飯！👇👇點擊下圖看9款街頭小食熱量👇👇</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210511/468844321546702848821749.jpeg/r-8kt--YpBHnnJtnlrAqNFamkCPyjTG_cDj4-HA4-Pg\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210511/468844323719483392359874.jpeg/hb7jdCELXZUT7269iTbm-FDXkmDKA8oUPHyQljx8kJY\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210511/468844325829349376348067.jpeg/SRlS3EhRb-wxodriGwgQO3O16UZ-pYFIQC3jSUAt40k\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210511/468844328375422976146935.jpeg/Gy3bMCBpTIEx0JBi9Syx9M2w4VfuSWgbS7p-EEu6fhA\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210511/468844331026354176437128.jpeg/u4QZcVCHTNTgNwld5TioVt9XACYjciHOacOFiWnDhYk\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210511/468844346683822080715249.jpeg/BIRVDTV6i3lvL8ZAI97D60T_V8UkMKFSBEGJcgRBiXI\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210511/468844364090314752712905.jpeg/GVxHHqH2dlkwwuutD4LpnuI6yQLtcMCipeSOyKXkjsg\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210511/468844378208473088620351.jpeg/f2jL0snxj2FgxYjwKwPtOGNfotR-CqHXq-mFpavphaU\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210511/468844380888764416670348.jpeg/xAuOLtZexyPF-gAOABZY_KAY78HMGOuXxK3susSt7Lo\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210511/468844383447420928269380.jpeg/oEsKW-lydQ7QCc_OYlgDOup-0lOy-wOUQDqrMkA6qzI\"><p>鳴謝資訊提供：healthlife_katy</p><p>😎知多啲：51款甜味汽水果汁能量飲品含糖量😎</p><p>消委會早前測試市面上共51款甜味飲品，當中20款屬高糖，而且全部均有使用甜味劑，29款更使用2種或以上甜味劑，並有2款能量飲品的甜味劑用量較建議高出4倍。👇👇點擊下圖看51款甜味飲品含糖量👇👇</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210325/451767974672470016769301.jpeg/Kon8JYDtUs5GtOs3zA-gWNZ1IKNY8kCfINKk4SDSpOE\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210325/451767976924942336625084.jpeg/3KS6NF9jurX3qhmcENR7xoaL9BL2qlJC1fYfT9X2H08\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210325/451767979890446336743921.jpeg/F2SsJ31N5gZlivJJe4yRUt1v_Z0RPQcgWS3xJFkt8SQ\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210325/451767981874483200108435.jpeg/PQ72LdoBD86rZJC4aEzr2PRg85GBEXJtxZKjk8WSo5M\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210325/451767983871102976863729.jpeg/-lJaYz0KoL7nRkhiytglq91siyLKyYiCAPBEUgDwRFI\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210325/451767986299736064319280.jpeg/SKtX25nI4iPO8lwNJF2DIKlUdwJy6yxgXvWlVV71pVU\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210325/451767988367659008562401.jpeg/WIBS2QYjzPLsChNJEwtuQHunNwU3Z_lV5sULGubFCxo\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210325/451767990532050944573094.jpeg/a0Y0TiQdgCRP9iRpoP61Z5zBozd1quLERyvHL0crxy8\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210325/451767992931323904860943.jpeg/ayqGIGr1d8DQ4dTFcBm72tJTUvol0FGkUsIH6VLCB-k\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210325/451767995053772800427180.jpeg/tsbIUs8ijeFyIJGirJXn2EPO1HRzr6dEK0vIBytLyAc\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210312/447094831139786752125796.jpeg/zHyg3EGBWTuwd6FjSS0qtCIy4cQwDvslKHFU2ChxVNg\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210325/451767974903156736420165.jpeg/dmjgT8Ql3HHxMg5OcqV4XiZ5yNpQzyV5hD-RY4Q_kWM\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210325/451767976916553728374562.jpeg/jUBvyvG0MbIbwyVrOjvixjRPvzQKuJ2Kfp7-HH6e_hw\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210325/451767979332603904395240.jpeg/GsmfftM2JiYWXxJ3u1tw3VjDnU-XCdsLfKve4Xyr3uE\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210325/451767981757042688546293.jpeg/e0rKnQD-_mb0gf7nxChv6y